1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,280
Good morning, Riverside Community Centre.
How can I help?

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:08,900
Hi, I'm calling about the beginner's
cookery course. Is there still space?

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,713
There is. Now, the intermediate
class is on Thursdays,

4
00:00:12,737 --> 00:00:15,872
but the beginner's class
is on Tuesday evenings.

5
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:18,680
Tuesday's fine. How long is each session?

6
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:21,700
They're two hours each,
from seven until nine.

7
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,860
And how many weeks does it run for?

8
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:26,688
The intermediate course
is twelve weeks, but

9
00:00:26,712 --> 00:00:29,572
the beginner's one is
shorter. It's eight weeks.

10
00:00:29,735 --> 00:00:32,840
Eight weeks? Good. Are the classes big?

11
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:38,172
No, we never take more than twelve students,
so everyone gets plenty of attention.

12
00:00:38,535 --> 00:00:40,660
Where are the classes held? In the hall?

13
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:43,321
No, the hall's for
exercise classes.

14
00:00:43,345 --> 00:00:46,772
Cookery's in our training
kitchen on the first floor.

15
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,420
Do I need to bring any equipment?

16
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:53,300
Knives, pans and so on are all provided.
Just bring your own apron, please.

17
00:00:53,580 --> 00:00:55,820
What about food? Do I bring that?

18
00:00:56,019 --> 00:01:00,060
No, we supply all the ingredients.
That's included in the fee.

19
00:01:00,250 --> 00:01:02,780
Oh, that's easy. What do you start with?

20
00:01:03,239 --> 00:01:05,856
The first week is all
about basic knife skills.

21
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:08,732
Chopping onions without
crying, that sort of thing.

22
00:01:08,914 --> 00:01:10,900
Ha! I definitely need that.

23
00:01:11,049 --> 00:01:15,440
And everyone gets a recipe booklet on the
first evening, so you can practice at home.

24
00:01:15,699 --> 00:01:17,160
What happens in the last week?

25
00:01:17,379 --> 00:01:20,177
The last week's the fun
one. You each cook a dinner

26
00:01:20,201 --> 00:01:23,012
for friends or family, and
they come in and eat it.

27
00:01:23,199 --> 00:01:25,980
That sounds great. Who teaches the course?

28
00:01:26,224 --> 00:01:30,800
Rosa. She used to be a chef at a
hotel in town, and she's brilliant.

29
00:01:31,299 --> 00:01:32,780
And how much is it?

30
00:01:33,569 --> 00:01:36,852
It's £10 per session. You
pay a deposit of £20 to

31
00:01:36,876 --> 00:01:40,171
reserve your place, and
that comes off the total.

32
00:01:40,494 --> 00:01:42,820
Can I pay the deposit
by card over the phone?

33
00:01:43,115 --> 00:01:45,392
Our card machine's
being replaced at the

34
00:01:45,416 --> 00:01:47,992
moment, so it'll have
to be by bank transfer.

35
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:50,740
That's fine.
Is there anything else I should know?

36
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,889
Yes. If you've got any
allergies, you need to

37
00:01:53,913 --> 00:01:57,072
tell us in advance, so
Rosa can plan around them.

38
00:01:57,210 --> 00:01:59,800
No allergies, luckily. Is there parking?

39
00:02:00,139 --> 00:02:04,620
The front car park is pay and display, but
the rear car park is free in the evenings.

40
00:02:04,999 --> 00:02:07,140
Good. And can I take the food home?

41
00:02:07,994 --> 00:02:11,281
You can. Most people
bring a plastic container.

42
00:02:11,305 --> 00:02:14,112
Glass ones have been
broken in the past.

43
00:02:14,564 --> 00:02:17,460
What if I start and it's not for me?

44
00:02:17,860 --> 00:02:21,671
If you cancel during the first
week, you get a full refund.

45
00:02:21,695 --> 00:02:24,372
After that, I'm afraid
there's no refund.

46
00:02:24,804 --> 00:02:27,680
That's fair.
When does the next course start?

47
00:02:28,150 --> 00:02:32,540
The August course is full, so
the next one starts in September.

48
00:02:33,220 --> 00:02:38,440
September! Great! And if I enjoy it,
can I go on to the intermediate course?

49
00:02:38,720 --> 00:02:43,560
Of course. That one's always popular,
so you'd need to join the waiting list.

50
00:02:43,900 --> 00:02:46,140
I'll think about it. Thanks for your help.

51
00:02:46,141 --> 00:02:48,860
You're welcome.
We look forward to seeing you.

